abstract: >-
  A modular research-software toolkit for evidence-governed AI-assisted reasoning,
  prior-art discovery, formal reasoning, engineering verification, evaluation,
  process assurance, and adaptive complementary assistance with saved user profiles,
  structured cross-cutting calibration, and real-work transfer assessment.
